    <div class="detail-index">
      08
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Expected benefits
      </h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Reduced solar heat absorption
        </li>

        <li>
          Lower summer indoor temperatures
        </li>

        <li>
          Reduced air-conditioning demand
        </li>

        <li>
          Lower electricity consumption
        </li>

        <li>
          Reduction of associated CO2 emissions
        </li>

        <li>
          Improved thermal comfort for employees
        </li>

        <li>
          Passive solution with no active mechanical system
        </li>

        <li>
          Modernisation of the external appearance of industrial buildings
        </li>

      </ul>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- 09 | DEPLOYMENT -->

  <section class="portfolio-visual-section">

    <div class="portfolio-section-header">

      <span>
        09 | Deployment
      </span>

      <h2>
        From Clim'Act proposal to a real building.
      </h2>

    </div>


    <div class="process-grid">

      <figure>

        <img
          src="/images/projects/clim-act/before.jpg"
          alt="Fives building before reflective coating"
        />

        <figcaption>
          Before | Existing industrial envelope
        </figcaption>

      </figure>


      <figure>

        <img
          src="/images/projects/clim-act/application.jpg"
          alt="Application of reflective white coating"
        />

        <figcaption>
          Implementation | Reflective coating
        </figcaption>

      </figure>


      <figure>

        <img
          src="/images/projects/clim-act/after.jpg"
          alt="Fives industrial building after white reflective coating"
        />

        <figcaption>
          After | High-reflectivity exterior surface
        </figcaption>

      </figure>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- 10 | FEEDBACK -->

  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      10
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        First feedback
      </h2>

      <p>
        Initial feedback following implementation has been encouraging.
      </p>

      <p>
        Observations during 2025 indicated lower electricity consumption and
        reduced demand on air-conditioning systems.
      </p>

      <p>
        The renovation also received positive feedback regarding the brighter,
        more modern appearance of the buildings.
      </p>

      <p>
        Exact performance values are kept separate from this portfolio until
        validated data can be publicly communicated.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


