  <!-- 13 | LEARNING -->

  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      13
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        What I learned
      </h2>

      <p>
        Clim'Act showed me that industrial decarbonisation does not always require
        a complex technological system.
      </p>

      <p>
        A relatively simple passive solution can become relevant when its physical
        principles are understood, quantified and applied at the scale of an
        industrial site.
      </p>

      <p>
        The project also gave me experience working across different Fives entities,
        connecting technical research, economic feasibility and practical implementation.
      </p>

